{"code":"E2","wikidata":"Q4921113","wikipedia":{"en":"Phloen Chit BTS station","th":"สถานีเพลินจิต"},"summary":{"en":"Phloen Chit station is a BTS skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Pathum Wan District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is located on Phloen Chit Road at Phloen Chit intersection, where Phloen Chit intersects with Witthayu Road next to the beginning of Sukhumvit Road. It is surrounded by hotels, skyscrapers, office towers and many embassies especially the British and American embassies on Wireless Road.","th":"สถานีเพลินจิต เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนเพลินจิตบริเวณทางแยกเพลินจิต ในพื้นที่เขตปทุมวัน กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Phloen_Chit_BTS_Station.jpg/960px-Phloen_Chit_BTS_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phloen_Chit_BTS_Station.jpg","author":"Crcolas","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/BTS_Phloen_Chit_Station.JPG/960px-BTS_Phloen_Chit_Station.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Phloen_Chit_Station.JPG","author":"Terence Ong","license":"CC BY 2.5"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Here_Comes_the_Skytrain_%28BTS%29_%2818522940112%29.jpg/960px-Here_Comes_the_Skytrain_%28BTS%29_%2818522940112%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Here_Comes_the_Skytrain_(BTS)_(18522940112).jpg","author":"Michael Coghlan from Adelaide, Australia","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Phloen_Chit_Station_20230923-1.jpg/960px-Phloen_Chit_Station_20230923-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_camp